<title>USA: Thermo, AT&amp;T Capital form Thermo Capital.</title>
<headline>Thermo, AT&amp;T Capital form Thermo Capital.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Electron Corp and AT&amp;T Capital Corp said on Thursday they have formed Thermo Capital Co LLC, a full-service lease-financing company.</p>
<p>Thermo Electron and AT&amp;T Capital agreed to fund the equally owned joint venture.</p>
<p>Under the new agreement, complete leasing packages that include equipment, supplies and service will be made available to all qualified Thermo Electron customers.</p>
</text>
